# Background Jobs / Schedulers

## Quy tac chung

- Co muc dich ro rang.
- Co co che tranh duplicate neu can.
- Co log /start, end, so record xu ly, error/.
- Co idempotency /xem idempotency.mdc/.
- Khong am tham thay doi du lieu ngoai business rule.

## Multi-instance safety

- Hien tai chua dung ShedLock /verified: codebase khong co @SchedulerLock / shedlock//.
- Moi job phai tu dam bao idempotency de an toan khi chay 2+ instance.
- Khi scale horizontal, phai them ShedLock hoac dung DB row lock /vd: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED/.

## Job hien tai

- processExpiredReservations: 15s, quet Order PENDING_PAYMENT qua 300s, chuyen CANCELLED_TIMEOUT.
- processEndedSlotsAndReturnUnsoldStock: 30s, dong phien ENDED, hoan tra available_stock.
- image cleanup: daily, xoa anh orphaned /chua co owner/ - placeholder.

Tat ca scheduler method dung @Scheduled/fixedDelayString = / de cadence configurable.

